    <briefdescription>
<para>Thin wrapper around &quot;int&quot; used to store reaching definitions, using an encoding that makes it compatible with <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_tiny_ptr_vector" kindref="compound">TinyPtrVector</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The 0th LSB is forced zero (and will be used for pointer union tagging), The 1st LSB is forced one (to make sure the value is non-zero). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
